From 16f24748cf308b1d1272767988461c6f874a7e9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@local>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:42:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/29] turnip/a5xx: make the compute MVP work on Adreno 509

Fix the remaining bring-up issues found on hardware:

 - create the ir3 compiler without preamble/shared-const support on a5xx,
 - skip empty shaders and the binning preamble for the compute-only path,
 - provide an a5xx trace timestamp callback,
 - lower SSBO intrinsics to a bindful slot before descriptor lowering and
   record the SSBO map while the variables still exist,
 - keep num_ssbos populated for nir_lower_amul,
 - use an explicit builder cursor in the bindful SSBO pass.

With these, the storage-buffer compute smoke test writes 512/512 correct
values on Adreno 509.

